{"title": "Key of the Ancients", "pageid": 3949, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Key_of_the_Ancients", "categories": ["Helmets", "Story items", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png/300px-Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/4/49/Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Key of the Ancients image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png/300px-Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>This version of the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Key of the Ancients</span></a> is a story rarity <a href=\"/wiki/Headwear\" title=\"Headwear\">Helmet</a> which grants the wearer a bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">Nature</a> checks.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The branches of this circlet are half-fossilised, passed down through generations of <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">druids</a>. Fabricated during the founding of the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">grove</a>, the wreath is forever linked to its lands, the tiny rubies connected to its stones and structures, bidding them to do their bidding.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" title=\"Helmets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/38px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/50px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helmets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 90 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  90  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_DEN_AppCirclet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_DEN_AppCirclet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_DEN_AppCirclet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">59b54a3c-1825-49a3-b216-830edfd388ab</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:59b54a3c-1825-49a3-b216-830edfd388ab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:59b54a3c-1825-49a3-b216-830edfd388ab\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_Druid_Helmet_Circlet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_Druid_Helmet_Circlet+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_Druid_Helmet_Circlet+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Nature_Icon.png/25px-Nature_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Nature_Icon.png/38px-Nature_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Nature_Icon.png/50px-Nature_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nature\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Nature_Icon.png/25px-Nature_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Nature_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">Nature</a> +1</li>\n<li>While standing in front of the stone door in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nettie\" title=\"Nettie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/25px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/38px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/50px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nettie's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/25px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nettie\" title=\"Nettie\">Nettie's</a> room in the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid_Grove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druid Grove\">Druid Grove</a>, you can open a shortcut to the <a href=\"/wiki/Underground_Passage\" title=\"Underground Passage\">Underground Passage</a>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Underground_Passage\" title=\"Underground Passage\">Underground Passage</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-438&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-180</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Findal\" title=\"Findal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_Findal.png/25px-Portrait_Findal.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_Findal.png/38px-Portrait_Findal.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_Findal.png/50px-Portrait_Findal.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Findal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_Findal.png/25px-Portrait_Findal.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Portrait_Findal.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Findal\" title=\"Findal\">Findal</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underground_Passage\" title=\"Underground Passage\">Underground Passage</a> that connects to the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid_Grove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druid Grove\">Druid Grove</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-hrule nomobile\" style=\"user-select: none;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"460\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<p><br>\n \n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variant\">Variant</span></h1>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png/300px-Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/4/49/Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Key of the Ancients image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png/300px-Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Key_of_the_Ancients_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>This version of the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Key of the Ancients</span></a> is an uncommon rarity <a href=\"/wiki/Headwear\" title=\"Headwear\">Helmet</a> which grants the wearer a bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">Nature</a> checks.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The branches of this circlet are half-fossilised, passed down through generations of <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">druids</a>. Fabricated during the founding of the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">grove</a>, the wreath is forever linked to its lands, the tiny rubies connected to its stones and structures, bidding them to do their bidding.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties_2\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" title=\"Helmets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/38px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/50px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helmets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wik