.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nature\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Nature_Icon.png/25px-Nature_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Nature_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">Nature</a> +1</li>\n<li>While standing in front of the stone door in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nettie\" title=\"Nettie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/25px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/38px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/50px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nettie's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/25px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nettie\" title=\"Nettie\">Nettie's</a> room in the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid_Grove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druid Grove\">Druid Grove</a>, you can open a shortcut to the <a href=\"/wiki/Underground_Passage\" title=\"Underground Passage\">Underground Passage</a>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find_2\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Druids%27_Chambers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druids' Chambers\">Druids' Chambers</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-440&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;6</span>: Carried by <a href=\"/wiki/Nettie\" title=\"Nettie\">Nettie</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galle